  "details": "My friend is realy paranoid about some one stealing her avatar. Thats why she is always going into public/friends+ with a public avatar. I dont know how it works with the \"theft\" of others avatars but they would lose intress if there was a way to prevent \"avatar theft\" in the first place. You could be able to enable your avatar to certain users. It adding to the visitors/newUser/etc. system.\n\nPS:It can also helps if you think that your avatar might cause lag, crashes or annoys some one else",
